WEBVTT

00:09.034 --> 00:10.413
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.517 --> 00:12.206
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.310 --> 00:13.655
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.758 --> 00:15.448
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.551 --> 00:18.517
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.620 --> 00:20.724
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.827 --> 00:22.758
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.862 --> 00:24.793
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.896 --> 00:26.482
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.586 --> 00:28.793
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.896 --> 00:30.310
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.413 --> 00:32.758
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.862 --> 00:34.689
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.793 --> 00:36.724
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:36.827 --> 00:38.655
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.758 --> 00:40.620
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.724 --> 00:41.862
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.965 --> 00:44.172
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.275 --> 00:46.620
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.724 --> 00:48.931
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:49.034 --> 00:50.448
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:04.793 --> 01:07.689
- HOW ABOUT A LITTLE MORE,
PLANKTON?
- 再多一点怎么样，
浮游生物？

01:07.793 --> 01:11.241
OR HAS THIS OLD GRANNY
HAD ENOUGH FOR ONE NIGHT?
或者有这个老奶奶
住了一晚够吗？

01:11.344 --> 01:12.758
- OH, GRAMMA,
- 哦，奶奶，

01:12.862 --> 01:15.689
YOU KNOW I ALWAYS HAVE
MORE PUDDING FOR YOU.
你知道我一直都有
更多布丁给您。

01:15.793 --> 01:19.586
- OH, THAT LOOKS
SIMPLY DELIGHTFUL.
- 哦，看起来是这样
简直令人愉快。

01:19.689 --> 01:22.034
- YOU ONCE TOLD ME THAT THIS
WAS YOUR FAVORITE FLAVOR
- 你曾经告诉过我这个
是您最喜欢的口味吗

01:22.137 --> 01:23.758
GROWING UP AS A CHILD.
小时候的成长。

01:23.862 --> 01:25.137
- RATION?
- 口粮？

01:25.241 --> 01:26.620
- ER, NO, CHOCOLATE.
- 呃，不，巧克力。

01:26.724 --> 01:27.758
OPEN UP.
打开。

01:27.862 --> 01:31.413
[creaking]
[吱吱作响]

01:31.517 --> 01:34.344
SHOOM!
嗖！

01:34.448 --> 01:36.827
YOU CAN LET GO
OF THE SPOON NOW, GRAMMA.
你可以放手
现在是勺子了，奶奶。

01:36.931 --> 01:38.551
THERE.
OOP.
那里。
面向对象编程。

01:38.655 --> 01:40.620
LOOKS LIKE YOU GOT A LITTLE
ON YOUR FACE.
看起来你有一点
在你的脸上。

01:40.724 --> 01:42.724
HERE, LET ME.
在这里，让我来。

01:42.827 --> 01:45.862
THERE YOU ARE.
THERE YOU ARE, DARLING.
你就在那里。
亲爱的，你在这里。

01:45.965 --> 01:50.793
- OH, PLANKTON, YOU ALWAYS WERE
MY FAVORITE GRANDDAUGHTER.
- 哦，浮游生物，你一直都是
我最喜欢的孙女。

01:50.896 --> 01:52.206
[door clicks open]
[门咔哒一声打开]

01:52.310 --> 01:54.241
- FIVE MINUTES UNTIL BEDTIME,
MR. PLANKTON.
- 距离就寝时间还有五分钟，
先生。浮游生物。

01:54.344 --> 01:57.275
- WELL, GRAMMA, THAT'S
THE SWEETEST, MOST TENDER--
- 嗯，语法，就是这样
最甜蜜、最温柔——

01:57.379 --> 01:58.344
- FIVE MINUTES, MR. PLA--
- 五分钟，先生。解放军--

01:58.448 --> 02:00.758
- I HEARD YOU
THE FIRST TIME!
- 我听到你了
第一次！

02:00.862 --> 02:02.862
NOW, WHERE WERE WE?
现在，我们在哪里？

02:02.965 --> 02:04.068
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

02:04.172 --> 02:07.586
- GRAMMA,
DON'T FORGET YOUR TEETH.
- 语法，
不要忘记您的牙齿。

02:11.965 --> 02:14.551
- [coughing]
- [咳嗽]

02:14.655 --> 02:15.758
- OOH.
-哦。

02:15.862 --> 02:18.068
NOW, NOW, GRAMMA,
JUST RELAX.
现在，现在，奶奶，
放松一下。

02:18.172 --> 02:19.068
THERE, THERE.
那里，那里。

02:19.172 --> 02:22.034
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

02:22.137 --> 02:24.000
- THAT'S PERFECT.
- 那很完美。

02:28.827 --> 02:30.137
PERFECT.
完美的。

02:30.241 --> 02:33.137
[laughing maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

02:36.620 --> 02:39.034
WHY DIDN'T I
THINK OF THIS BEFORE?
我为什么不
之前想到过这个吗？

02:39.137 --> 02:43.896
NO ONE CAN SAY NO
TO A HELPLESS LITTLE GRANDMA.
没有人可以说不
致无助的小奶奶。

02:44.000 --> 02:46.586
EXCUSE ME, SONNY,
I'D SIMPLY LOVE
对不起，索尼，
我就是喜欢

02:46.689 --> 02:48.206
ONE OF YOUR KRABBY WHATSITS,
你的蟹钳之一是什么，

02:48.310 --> 02:51.689
BUT MY DELICATE DIGESTIVE SYSTEM
HAS SPECIAL NEEDS,
但我脆弱的消化系统
有特殊需要，

02:51.793 --> 02:55.275
AND I'LL NEED TO SEE
A COMPLETE LIST OF INGREDIENTS.
我需要看看
完整的成分清单。

02:55.379 --> 02:57.310
YOU WOULDN'T WANT ME
TO BE UP ALL NIGHT
你不会想要我
彻夜不眠

02:57.413 --> 02:59.344
WITH PAINFUL BLOATING,
WOULD YOU?
伴有疼痛的腹胀，
你愿意吗？

02:59.448 --> 03:02.068
- GOODNESS, NO.
- 天哪，不。

03:02.172 --> 03:04.034
HERE YA ARE.
你在这里。

03:04.137 --> 03:05.482
- THANKS, SONNY.
- 谢谢，索尼。

03:05.586 --> 03:07.206
I'M JUST GOING
TO TAKE IT HOME.
我这就去
把它带回家。

03:07.310 --> 03:09.241
I LEFT MY BIFOCALS THERE.
我把双光眼镜留在那里了。

03:10.724 --> 03:13.655
[laughing]
[笑]

03:16.655 --> 03:19.034
- ♪ LA, LA-LA-LA, LA-LA
- ♪ 拉，拉-拉-拉，拉-拉

03:19.137 --> 03:20.655
♪ LA, LA-LA-LA, LA-LA
♪ 拉，拉-拉-拉，拉-拉

03:24.931 --> 03:27.551
YAY!
A DIRECT HIT.
耶！
直接打击。

03:27.655 --> 03:29.448
THREAT NEUTRALIZED,
CAPTAIN.
威胁已消除，
船长。

03:29.551 --> 03:31.586
ROGER, OVER.
罗杰，结束了。

03:31.689 --> 03:33.206
RIGHT AWAY, CAPTAIN.
马上，队长。

03:33.310 --> 03:35.586
ALL HANDS,
PREPARE TO DIVE.
全体同仁，
准备潜水。

03:35.689 --> 03:37.482
REPEAT, PREPARE TO--
重复一遍，准备——

03:37.586 --> 03:38.758
[knock at door]
[敲门]

03:38.862 --> 03:42.241
[footsteps squishing]
[脚步声嘎吱作响]

03:42.344 --> 03:43.965
- AHEM!
- 咳咳！

03:44.068 --> 03:44.965
- HI, LADY.
- 嗨，女士。

03:45.068 --> 03:46.724
- WHY, SPONGEBOB,
- 为什么，海绵宝宝，

03:46.827 --> 03:48.620
DON'T YOU RECOGNIZE ME?
你不认识我了吗？

03:48.724 --> 03:50.827
- EEH, NOT REALLY.
- 呃，不是真的。

03:50.931 --> 03:55.551
- IT'S ME, YOUR DEAR OLD
GREAT-GRAMMY-MAW.
- 这是我，你亲爱的老人
伟大的格莱美音乐奖。

03:55.655 --> 03:58.413
- [gasps]
QUICK, COME INSIDE.
- [喘气]
快，进来吧。

03:58.517 --> 03:59.448
WOW.
哇。

03:59.551 --> 04:01.896
MY VERY OWN GREAT-GRAMMY-MAW.
我自己的伟大格莱美。

04:02.000 --> 04:03.172
WHY HAVE WE NEVER MET?
为什么我们从未见过面？

04:03.275 --> 04:06.931
- I WANT TO KNOW
ALL ABOUT YOUR LIFE, YOUR JOB,
- 我想知道
关于你的生活、你的工作的一切，

04:07.034 --> 04:10.344
WHERE THE SECRET FORMULA IS--
ER, I MEAN--
秘密公式在哪里——
呃，我的意思是——

04:10.448 --> 04:13.379
- [sniffles]
I'M SO GLAD YOU CAME BACK,
- [抽鼻子]
我很高兴你回来了，

04:13.482 --> 04:15.793
DOUBLE-GREAT-GRAMMY-MAW.
双伟大格莱美奖。

04:15.896 --> 04:16.931
- ICK.
- ICK。
- ICK。
- ICK。
- ICK。
- ICK。
- ICK。
- ICK。

04:17.034 --> 04:19.034
[shudders]
[颤抖]

04:19.137 --> 04:20.448
- YOU'RE COLD.
- 你很冷。

04:20.551 --> 04:23.448
LET'S WRAP YOU UP
IN SOMETHING NICE AND COZY.
让我们把你包起来
美好而舒适的事物。

04:25.413 --> 04:27.689
OKAY, LEAN FORWARD.
好的，向前倾。

04:27.793 --> 04:29.172
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:29.275 --> 04:31.655
- THERE WE GO.
- 我们开始了。

04:31.758 --> 04:34.000
NOW, LEAN BACK, GRAMMY-MAW.
现在，向后靠，格莱美奖。

04:34.103 --> 04:35.793
IT'S THE COZIEST PILLOW
I HAVE.
这是最舒适的枕头
我有。

04:38.344 --> 04:40.724
- [muffled screaming]
- [低沉的尖叫声]

04:40.827 --> 04:44.103
- HOW ABOUT WE LOOK THROUGH
SOME OLD FAMILY PHOTO ALBUMS?
- 我们来看看怎么样
一些旧的家庭相册？

04:44.206 --> 04:47.517
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

04:47.620 --> 04:48.793
- OH.
[chuckles]
- 哦。
[笑声]

04:48.896 --> 04:49.965
HERE'S A PICTURE OF ME
这是我的照片

04:50.068 --> 04:52.172
WHEN I DEVELOPED
MY FIRST APPENDAGE.
当我发育时
我的第一个附件。

04:52.275 --> 04:54.689
PRETTY NEAT PHOTO ALBUM, EH,
DOUBLE-G-GRAMMY-MAW?
相当整洁的相册，呃，
双 G 格莱美音乐？

04:54.793 --> 04:57.413
- IT WAS CERTAINLY
INTERESTING,
- 确实如此
有趣的是，

04:57.517 --> 05:00.344
BUT I'D LIKE TO HEAR
ABOUT YOUR MORE RECENT AFFAIRS,
但我想听听
关于您最近的事情，

05:00.448 --> 05:02.793
LIKE WHERE YOU WORK,
FOR INSTANCE.
就像你工作的地方一样，
例如。

05:02.896 --> 05:04.172
- [laughs]
DON'T WORRY.
- [笑]
别担心。

05:04.275 --> 05:05.793
I'VE GOT PICTURES
OF THAT TOO.
我有照片
也是如此。

05:05.896 --> 05:07.931
BUT WE HAVE A COUPLE MORE
FROM MY EARLY CHILDHOOD
但我们还有更多
从我的童年开始

05:08.034 --> 05:09.000
TO GET THROUGH FIRST.
首先完成任务。

05:09.103 --> 05:10.413
- NEVER LET IT BE SAID
- 永远不要说出来

05:10.517 --> 05:13.275
THAT I DIDN'T SUFFER
FOR MY OCCUPATION.
我没有受苦
为了我的职业。

05:13.379 --> 05:15.172
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

05:15.275 --> 05:17.344
[rooster crows]
[公鸡打鸣]

05:17.448 --> 05:20.000
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

05:20.103 --> 05:22.413
HUH?
嗯？

05:22.517 --> 05:23.620
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

05:23.724 --> 05:27.172
- [whispering]
GREAT-GRAMMY-MAW.
- [低语]
伟大的格莱美音乐奖。

05:27.275 --> 05:28.413
- HUH?
- 嗯？

05:28.517 --> 05:31.655
OH, I HAD THE MOST HORRIBLE
DREAM OF MY LIFE.
哦，我经历了最可怕的事情
我的人生梦想。

05:31.758 --> 05:32.931
I WAS DRESSED UP AS--
我打扮成——

05:33.034 --> 05:36.206
HOLY MOTHER OF NEPTUNE,
IT'S TRUE.
海王星圣母，
这是真的。

05:36.310 --> 05:38.586
- GOOD MORNING.
- 早上好。

05:38.689 --> 05:40.689
I'LL GO AND FIX US
A NICE BREAKFAST,
我去修理我们
美味的早餐，

05:40.793 --> 05:43.689
AND THEN WE'LL SPEND
THE WHOLE DAY TOGETHER.
然后我们会花
一整天都在一起。

05:43.793 --> 05:46.344
- SOUNDS DELIGHTFUL.
- 听起来很愉快。

05:46.448 --> 05:48.379
[laughing]
[笑]

05:51.655 --> 05:53.551
- SO, GRAMMY-MAW,
WHAT KINDS OF THINGS
- 那么，格莱美奖，
什么样的事情

05:53.655 --> 05:55.689
DO YOU ACTIVE SENIORS
LIKE TO DO?
老年人活跃吗
喜欢做什么？

05:55.793 --> 05:57.344
- ACTUALLY, SPONGEBOB,
- 事实上，海绵宝宝，

05:57.448 --> 06:00.206
I SAID I WANTED TO SEE
YOUR LIFE, REMEMBER?
我说我想看看
你的生活，还记得吗？

06:00.310 --> 06:02.275
- HMM.
- 唔。

06:02.379 --> 06:05.896
- I WANT TO KNOW
ALL ABOUT YOUR LIFE, YOUR JOB,
- 我想知道
关于你的生活、你的工作的一切，

06:06.000 --> 06:09.206
WHERE THE SECRET FORMULA IS--
ER, I MEAN--
秘密公式在哪里——
呃，我的意思是——

06:09.310 --> 06:11.000
- NO.
- 不。

06:11.103 --> 06:13.517
YOU COULDN'T POSSIBLY CARE
ABOUT ANY OF THAT STUFF.
你不可能关心
关于任何这些东西。

06:13.620 --> 06:16.275
YOUR LIFE MUST BE
WAY MORE FULL AND EXCITING.
你的生活必须是
更加充实和令人兴奋。

06:16.379 --> 06:17.689
- WELL, UH...
- 嗯，呃...

06:17.793 --> 06:20.034
- COME ON.
IT'LL BE FUN.
- 快点。
这会很有趣。

06:22.724 --> 06:24.655
[slurping]
[发出声音]

06:24.758 --> 06:25.758
AHH.
啊啊。

06:25.862 --> 06:27.275
ISN'T THIS TEA DELICIOUS,
GRANDMA?
这茶不香吗
奶奶？

06:27.379 --> 06:30.379
- WHY, YES.
- 为什么，是的。

06:30.482 --> 06:32.275
[slurping]
[发出声音]

06:32.379 --> 06:34.034
HOW CAN YOU DRINK
THIS DRECK?
你怎么能喝酒
这糟透了？

06:34.137 --> 06:35.034
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

06:35.137 --> 06:36.344
- WHAT?
- 什么？

06:36.448 --> 06:38.379
- [laughs nervously]
- [紧张地笑]

06:38.482 --> 06:42.206
WHAT I MEANT TO SAY WAS,
"MORE, PLEASE."
我想说的是，
“请再多一点。”

06:48.103 --> 06:51.137
- KNITTING CIRCLES SURE ARE FUN,
EH, GRAMMY-MAW?
- 编织圆圈确实很有趣，
呃，格莱美奖？

06:51.241 --> 06:52.310
- NOPE.
- 没有。

06:52.413 --> 06:53.793
- WHY ARE YOU NOT
HAVING FUN?
- 你为什么不呢
玩得开心吗？

06:53.896 --> 06:54.965
- WHY?
- 为什么？

06:55.068 --> 06:57.517
BECAUSE I DON'T KNIT,
YOU NITWIT.
因为我不会编织，
你这个白痴。

06:57.620 --> 06:59.758
- ARE YOU SURE?
- 你确定吗？

06:59.862 --> 07:02.689
'CAUSE YOU MAKE
A REAL NICE SCARF.
因为你让
一条真正漂亮的围巾。

07:05.034 --> 07:07.448
AW, GREAT-GRAMMY-MAW,
YOU WIN AGAIN.
啊，伟大的格莱美音乐奖，
你又赢了。

07:07.551 --> 07:10.103
ALL HAIL THE GREAT
CANASTA-MASTA.
所有人向伟大致敬
卡纳斯塔-玛斯塔。

07:13.586 --> 07:15.344
GRANDMA,
YOU GETTIN' BORED?
奶奶，
你感到无聊了吗？

07:15.448 --> 07:17.413
- NO, I'M GETTING HUNGRY.
- 不，我饿了。

07:17.517 --> 07:20.206
I CAN FEEL MY OWN STOMACH ACIDS
EATING AWAY AT MY ORGANS.
我能感觉到自己的胃酸
吞噬我的器官。

07:20.310 --> 07:21.413
I COULD EAT A VILLAGE.
我可以吃掉一个村庄。

07:21.517 --> 07:24.206
- WOULD YOU SETTLE
FOR A KRABBY PATTY?
- 你愿意安顿下来吗
想要蟹肉饼吗？

07:24.310 --> 07:25.965
- WOULD I?
- 我会吗？

07:26.068 --> 07:29.000
[giggles maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

07:32.448 --> 07:33.620
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

07:33.724 --> 07:35.655
YEAH, I WOULD.
是的，我愿意。

07:38.517 --> 07:40.482
UH, SPONGEBOB,
WOULD YOU MIND TERRIBLY
呃，海绵宝宝，
你会非常介意吗

07:40.586 --> 07:42.551
IF WE USED
THE REAR ENTRANCE?
如果我们使用
后门？

07:42.655 --> 07:45.000
I'M A LITTLE SHY
AROUND NEW PEOPLE.
我有点害羞
围绕新人。

07:45.103 --> 07:46.137
- HMM.
- 唔。

07:46.241 --> 07:48.379
HEY, GRAMMY, DO ANTENNAE
RUN IN OUR FAMILY?
嘿，格莱美，做天线
我们家有跑步吗？

07:48.482 --> 07:50.172
- ANTENNAE?
WHAT, NO, I--
- 天线？
什么，不，我——

07:50.275 --> 07:51.344
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

07:51.448 --> 07:53.310
AW, SHE REALLY IS SHY.
噢，她真的很害羞。

07:53.413 --> 07:55.689
NOBODY EVER USES THIS DOOR
EXCEPT FOR ME AND--
从来没有人使用过这扇门
除了我和——

07:55.793 --> 07:56.689
SQUIDWARD.
章鱼哥。

07:56.793 --> 07:57.965
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:58.068 --> 07:59.862
- SPONGEBOB,
YOU HAVE BEEN WARNED
- 海绵宝宝，
您已被警告

07:59.965 --> 08:02.344
ABOUT LURKING BACK HERE
ON YOUR DAYS OFF.
关于潜伏在这里
在您休息日。

08:02.448 --> 08:04.034
- I'M JUST BRINGING IN
MY GREAT-GRAMMY-MAW
- 我只是带进来
我伟大的格莱美妈妈

08:04.137 --> 08:05.068
FOR SOME LUNCH.
吃午餐。

08:05.172 --> 08:06.137
- YOUR WHAT?
- 你的什么？

08:06.241 --> 08:08.482
- MY GREAT-GRAMMY-MAW.
- 我伟大的格莱美妈妈。

08:08.586 --> 08:10.000
SHE MUST BE HIDING.
她一定是躲起来了。

08:10.103 --> 08:11.379
WELL, SHE DID SAY
SHE WAS SHY.
嗯，她确实说过
她很害羞。

08:11.482 --> 08:12.689
- RIGHT.
- 正确的。

08:12.793 --> 08:16.379
SPONGEBOB, I PROMISE
NOT TO TELL MR. KRABS ABOUT THIS
海绵宝宝，我保证
不要告诉先生。蟹蟹关于这个

08:16.482 --> 08:19.551
IF YOU PROMISE THAT
I DON'T HAVE TO SEE YOU AGAIN
如果你承诺
我不必再见到你

08:19.655 --> 08:22.793
FOR THE REST OF THE DAY.
今天剩下的时间。

08:22.896 --> 08:25.379
- [coughing]
- [咳嗽]

08:25.482 --> 08:27.103
- GRAMMY, THERE YOU ARE.
- 格莱美，你来了。

08:27.206 --> 08:28.689
I WAS STARTING TO WORRY.
我开始担心了。

08:28.793 --> 08:30.655
- NEVER MIND.
- 没关系。

08:30.758 --> 08:33.000
JUST GET ME
INTO THAT KITCHEN.
来找我吧
进入那个厨房。

08:33.103 --> 08:34.689
- WELL, HERE IT IS.
- 嗯，就是这样。

08:34.793 --> 08:36.137
- AT LAST.
- 终于。

08:36.241 --> 08:37.689
- GRANDMA,
I'M JUST GONNA GO MAKE SURE
- 奶奶，
我只是要去确认一下

08:37.793 --> 08:39.620
THE RESTROOMS ARE STOCKED,
YOU KNOW, REAL QUICK.
洗手间备货充足，
你知道，真的很快。

08:39.724 --> 08:41.206
IT'S PART
OF MY DAY-OFF DUTIES.
这是一部分
我的休息日职责。

08:41.310 --> 08:45.310
- OKAY, I'LL BE STANDING
RIGHT HERE WHEN YOU GET BACK
- 好吧，我会站起来
当你回来时就在这里

08:45.413 --> 08:46.896
AND NOT OFF SOMEWHERE
SNOOPING AROUND
并且不在某个地方
窥探周围

08:47.000 --> 08:48.620
FOR THE SECRET FORMULA
OR ANYTHING.
对于秘密公式
或者任何东西。

08:48.724 --> 08:50.241
- [laughs]
WHAT?
- [笑]
什么？

08:50.344 --> 08:52.551
- NOTHING.
GO AHEAD.
- 没有什么。
前进。

08:52.655 --> 08:54.586
[laughs]
[笑]

08:56.965 --> 09:00.448
[air hissing]
[空气嘶嘶声]

09:00.551 --> 09:03.413
LET'S SEE HOW THIS DECOY
FLOATS YOUR BOAT.
让我们看看这个诱饵如何
让你的船漂浮起来。

09:03.517 --> 09:05.448
[laughs]
[笑]

09:12.689 --> 09:14.689
- OKAY, GRAMMY-MAW,
THAT'S TAKEN CARE OF.
- 好吧，格莱美奖，
已经解决了。

09:14.793 --> 09:15.862
I--
我 -

09:15.965 --> 09:17.517
GRAMMY-MAW?
格莱美奖？

09:17.620 --> 09:20.034
HMM, SHE MUST HAVE MADE HER
OWN WAY UP TO THE CASH REGISTER
嗯，一定是她造就了她
自行前往收银机

09:20.137 --> 09:21.620
ALL BY HERSELF.
全靠她自己。

09:21.724 --> 09:23.137
MAYBE I'LL CATCH UP
ON MY DISHWASHING
也许我会赶上
关于我的洗碗

09:23.241 --> 09:25.241
WHILE I HAVE THE CHANCE.
当我有机会的时候。

09:25.344 --> 09:27.793
THE KRUSTY KRAB MANUAL
SAYS IT IS ALWAYS A GOOD IDEA
脆皮蟹手册
说这总是一个好主意

09:27.896 --> 09:30.068
TO START BY TURNING
THE GARBAGE DISPOSAL ON
从转动开始
垃圾处理

09:30.172 --> 09:33.275
JUST IN CASE THERE IS ANY
LEFTOVER RUBBISH IN THE SINK.
以防万一有任何
水槽里残留的垃圾。

09:33.379 --> 09:34.551
[disposal grinding]
[一次性研磨]

09:34.655 --> 09:36.655
SOUNDS LIKE THERE'S SOMETHING
STUCK IN THE--
听起来好像有什么东西
陷入困境——

09:36.758 --> 09:39.379
GRANDMA!
奶奶！

09:41.034 --> 09:42.965
OH, I CAN'T BEAR TO LOOK.
哦，我不忍心看。

09:43.068 --> 09:46.655
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:46.758 --> 09:49.517
OH, DOUBLE-GREAT-GRAMMY-GRAMS,
哦，双伟大的格莱美奖，

09:49.620 --> 09:51.724
YOU WERE SO SOFT
AND FRAGILE,
你太软弱了
且脆弱，

09:51.827 --> 09:54.965
LIKE A--LIKE A--
LIKE A--
喜欢一个--喜欢一个--
像A--

09:55.068 --> 09:56.827
[sniffles]
LIKE A BALLOON.
[抽鼻子]
像气球一样。

09:56.931 --> 09:58.137
- SPONGEBOB.
- 海绵宝宝。

09:58.241 --> 09:59.965
SPONGEBOB, UP HERE.
海绵宝宝，在这儿。

10:00.068 --> 10:02.103
- GRANDMA?
IS THAT YOU?
- 奶奶？
那是你吗？

10:02.206 --> 10:03.448
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?
你还好吗？

10:03.551 --> 10:05.620
- OH, I'M ALL RIGHT,
- 哦，我没事，

10:05.724 --> 10:07.586
BUT I'VE BEEN GROUND
TO A PULP.
但我已经脚踏实地了
变成纸浆。

10:07.689 --> 10:12.344
IF ONLY THERE WAS A NICE,
COOL, SAFE PLACE NEARBY,
如果有一个很好的，
附近凉爽、安全的地方，

10:12.448 --> 10:17.482
LIKE A SAFE NEARBY,
WHERE I COULD REST AND RECOVER.
就像附近的保险箱一样，
我可以休息和恢复的地方。

10:17.586 --> 10:19.931
- WELL, THERE IS THE SAFE
WHERE MR. KRABS KEEPS
- 嗯，有保险箱
先生在哪里？蟹堡

10:20.034 --> 10:21.310
THE KRUSTY KRAB
SECRET FORMULA
脆皮蟹
秘密配方

10:21.413 --> 10:22.758
THAT PLANKTON'S
BEEN TRYING TO STEAL
那个浮游生物
一直试图偷窃

10:22.862 --> 10:23.862
FOR THE PAST BUNCH OF YEARS.
在过去的几年里。

10:23.965 --> 10:25.310
I DON'T THINK HE'D MIND
我认为他不会介意

10:25.413 --> 10:27.413
IF MY DEAR OLD GRAMMY-MAW
RESTS IN THERE.
如果我亲爱的老格莱美妈妈
就在那里休息。

10:27.517 --> 10:30.344
- WHY WOULD HE?
- 他为什么要这么做？

10:30.448 --> 10:31.517
- HERE WE GO.
- 开始了。

10:31.620 --> 10:34.413
I'LL COME BACK FOR YOU
A LITTLE LATER.
我会回来找你
稍后。

10:34.517 --> 10:38.068
- OH, I FEEL BETTER ALREADY.
- 哦，我感觉好多了。

10:38.172 --> 10:41.724
[snoring]
[打鼾]

10:41.827 --> 10:45.103
- [whispering]
SWEET DREAMS, GRAMMY-MAW.
- [低语]
甜蜜的梦，格莱美奖。

10:45.206 --> 10:47.689
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:47.793 --> 10:50.206
SWEET DREAMS INDEED,
FOOL.
确实是甜蜜的梦，
傻瓜。

10:50.310 --> 10:53.241
ONLY THIS DREAM
IS ABOUT TO BECOME A NIGHTMARE
只有这个梦想
即将成为一场噩梦

10:53.344 --> 10:54.965
FOR MR. KRABS.
对于先生。螃蟹。

10:55.068 --> 10:57.827
[laughs evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

10:57.931 --> 11:00.448
I'M JUST GOING TO SAVOR
THIS MOMENT,
我只是去品尝
这一刻，

11:00.551 --> 11:05.206
BECAUSE FOR ONCE IN MY LIFE,
FOR ONCE IN MY LIFE,
因为我一生中只有一次，
这是我一生中的一次，

11:05.310 --> 11:09.068
I FEEL TRULY ALIVE.
我感觉自己真的还活着。

11:09.172 --> 11:10.965
- PLANKTON.
- 浮游生物。

11:11.068 --> 11:12.931
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

11:13.034 --> 11:16.517
- YOU'VE BEEN
A VERY NAUGHTY BOY, PLANKTON.
- 你去过
浮游生物，一个非常顽皮的男孩。

11:16.620 --> 11:21.000
- BUT I--
GRAMMA, I CAN--
- 但是我--
奶奶，我可以——

11:21.103 --> 11:23.517
- I'VE BEEN LOOKING ALL OVER
FOR THIS STUFF.
- 我一直在到处寻找
对于这个东西。

11:23.620 --> 11:26.448
- GRAMMA, I CAN EXPLAIN.
- 语法，我可以解释。

11:26.551 --> 11:28.931
- I'M SURE YOU CAN.
- 我相信你可以。

11:29.034 --> 11:31.896
PLANKTON JR., YOU KNOW,
YOU ALWAYS WERE A--
小浮游生物，你知道，
你一直都是——

11:32.000 --> 11:33.206
- GRANDMA?
- 奶奶？

11:33.310 --> 11:35.413
[gasps]
YOU CAUGHT PLANKTON.
[喘气]
你捕获了浮游生物。

11:35.517 --> 11:36.655
LET ME GUESS.
让我猜猜。

11:36.758 --> 11:38.379
TRYING TO STEAL
THE SECRET FORMULA, RIGHT?
试图偷窃
秘密公式，对吧？

11:38.482 --> 11:41.724
- GET OUT OF MY WAY,
RAPSCALLION.
- 别挡我的路
RAP葱。

11:41.827 --> 11:45.000
I'VE HAD ENOUGH FOOLISHNESS
FOR ONE DAY.
我已经受够了愚蠢
就一天。

11:45.103 --> 11:48.000
- [moans]
- [呻吟]

12:02.103 --> 12:04.344
- [singing nonsense]
- [胡言乱语]

12:04.448 --> 12:06.344
[Gary yowls]
[加里嚎叫]

12:06.448 --> 12:07.827
OH, SORRY, GARE.
哦，对不起，车站。

12:07.931 --> 12:09.241
I THOUGHT YOU WERE DONE.
我以为你已经完成了。

12:15.379 --> 12:18.620
THIS SIDE OF TOWN
SURE HAS GONE DOWNHILL.
小镇的这一边
当然已经走下坡路了。

12:18.724 --> 12:21.310
UH, MR. KRABS?
呃，先生。螃蟹？

12:21.413 --> 12:22.965
WHAT ARE YOU DOING OUT HERE?
你在这儿做什么？

12:23.068 --> 12:26.862
- OH, YOU KNOW, UNWINDING,
ENJOYING THE FREE PARKING.
- 哦，你知道，放松，
享受免费停车。

12:29.241 --> 12:30.413
- OOH.
-哦。

12:30.517 --> 12:32.034
- [squelching]
- [压抑]

12:32.137 --> 12:33.689
- WHAT'S HAPPENING
TO YOUR CRITTER THERE?
- 发生了什么事
给你的小动物吗？

12:33.793 --> 12:35.000
- I'M NOT SURE,
- 我不知道，

12:35.103 --> 12:36.931
BUT WHENEVER HE DOES THAT,
HE FINDS CHANGE.
但每当他这样做时，
他发现了改变。

12:37.034 --> 12:38.827
- CHANGE,
AS IN LEGAL TENDER?
- 改变，
就像法定货币一样？

12:38.931 --> 12:39.862
- YEAH, WATCH.
- 是的，注意。

12:39.965 --> 12:43.172
- [meows]
- [喵]

12:43.275 --> 12:45.103
- WELL, SHIVER ME SHELL WAX.
- 好吧，让我颤抖一下贝壳蜡。

12:45.206 --> 12:47.965
YOU'RE LIKE A LITTLE
MONEY-DETECTING--
你就像一个小
验钞——

12:48.068 --> 12:50.758
UH, WHAT DO YOU CALL IT--
SNEAGLE.
呃，你怎么称呼它——
偷偷摸摸。

12:50.862 --> 12:51.793
- YOU MEAN SNAIL?
- 你是说蜗牛吗？

12:51.896 --> 12:53.137
- SAY, SPONGEBOB,
- 说吧，海绵宝宝，

12:53.241 --> 12:55.000
WHY DON'T YOU EVER
BRING YOUR LITTLE SNEAGLE
你为什么不这样做
带上你的小鬼

12:55.103 --> 12:56.413
TO WORK WITH YA?
和你一起工作吗？

12:56.517 --> 12:57.551
- BECAUSE YOU SAID
THAT PETS
- 因为你说
那只宠物

12:57.655 --> 12:59.241
WERE NOTHING
BUT DISEASE-CARRYING VERMIN
什么都不是
但携带疾病的害虫

12:59.344 --> 13:01.137
THAT SHOULD NEVER BE BROUGHT
TO THE WORKPLACE.
永远不应该带的东西
到工作场所。

13:01.241 --> 13:02.689
- OH, BUT THAT
WAS BEFORE I KNEW
- 哦，但是那个
在我知道之前

13:02.793 --> 13:04.931
THEY HAD SUCH
AN INCREDIBLE TALENT.
他们有这样的
令人难以置信的才华。

13:05.034 --> 13:06.482
- YES, BUT FOR SOME REASON,
- 是的，但出于某种原因，

13:06.586 --> 13:09.448
THE WHOLE PROCESS
CAUSES GARY GREAT DISCOMFORT.
整个过程
让加里非常不舒服。

13:09.551 --> 13:11.275
I COULD NEVER
DO THAT TO HIM.
我永远不能
对他这样做。

13:11.379 --> 13:12.551
- I COULD.
- 我可以。

13:14.034 --> 13:16.172
[coins jingling]
[金币叮当作响]

13:16.275 --> 13:17.241
- [meows]
- [喵]

13:17.344 --> 13:19.000
- THERE YOU GO.
BRING IN THAT CHANGE.
- 好了。
带来改变。

13:21.965 --> 13:24.206
- [squelching]
- [压抑]

13:24.310 --> 13:25.620
- [laughs]
- [笑]

13:28.517 --> 13:31.448
I'VE BEEN WORKING ON THIS ONE
FOR MONTHS.
我一直在研究这个
几个月来。

13:31.551 --> 13:33.379
[laughs]
[笑]

13:33.482 --> 13:34.793
- WHAT'S SO FUNNY,
MR. KRABS?
- 有什么好笑的，
先生。螃蟹？

13:34.896 --> 13:35.896
- OH, HI, SPONGEBOB.
- 哦，嗨，海绵宝宝。

13:36.000 --> 13:39.413
UH, WELL--
SAY, AREN'T YOU
呃，好吧——
说，你不是吗

13:39.517 --> 13:41.448
SUPPOSED TO BE OUT BACK
SCRAPING OUT THE DUMPSTER?
应该在后面
清理垃圾箱？

13:41.551 --> 13:42.793
- DONE AND DONE.
- 完成了。

13:42.896 --> 13:43.827
- THEN GET BACK THERE
- 然后回到那里

13:43.931 --> 13:45.586
AND SWAB THE POOP DECK,
SO TO SPEAK.
并擦拭船尾甲板，
这么说吧。

13:45.689 --> 13:46.896
- YES, SIR.
- 是的，先生。

13:48.517 --> 13:50.172
[coins jingling]
[金币叮当作响]

13:51.379 --> 13:52.862
- HEY, WHAT ARE YOU DOING
WITH MY CHANGE?
- 嘿，你在做什么
我的改变？

13:52.965 --> 13:53.931
- YOUR CHANGE?
- 你的改变？

13:54.034 --> 13:56.758
ANYTHING ON THE FLOOR
BE FAIR GAME.
地板上的任何东西
公平竞争。

13:58.931 --> 14:00.137
- HEY!
- 嘿！

14:08.137 --> 14:09.655
- [laughs]
- [笑]

14:09.758 --> 14:11.620
LOOKS LIKE I NEED POCKETS
FOR ME POCKETS.
看起来我需要口袋
为了我的口袋。

14:11.724 --> 14:13.620
[all muttering angrily]
[大家愤怒地嘀咕]

14:13.724 --> 14:15.793
HEY, WHERE'S EVERYBODY GOING?
嘿，大家都去哪儿了？

14:15.896 --> 14:17.241
WAIT.
COME BACK.
等待。
回来。

14:17.344 --> 14:18.482
AH, FINE.
啊，好吧。

14:18.586 --> 14:19.965
GO ON, THE LOT OF YA.
继续吧，你们这些人。

14:20.068 --> 14:22.758
WITH ME NEW MONEY FINDER HERE,
WHO NEEDS YA?
有了我这里的新理财者，
谁需要你？

14:22.862 --> 14:24.896
I WAS ABOUT
TO CLOSE UP SHOP ANYWAY.
我是关于
无论如何都要关闭商店。

14:25.000 --> 14:26.413
- CLOSE UP?
- 特写？

14:26.517 --> 14:28.724
COME ON, GARE,
YOU'RE GOING WITH ME.
来吧，火车站，
你跟我走吧。

14:28.827 --> 14:31.793
- YOU'RE NOT TAKING HIM HOME
WITH YA JUST YET.
- 你不会带他回家
就在你身边。

14:31.896 --> 14:34.000
UH, YOU HAVEN'T DEGREASED
THE FRYER.
呃，你还没脱脂
油炸锅。

14:34.103 --> 14:35.206
NOW, GET IN THERE AND DO IT.
现在，进入那里并开始行动。

14:35.310 --> 14:36.655
AND I DON'T WANT TO SEE YOU
TILL YOU DO.
我不想见你
直到你做到为止。

14:36.758 --> 14:37.896
- YEAH BUT--
- 是的但是--

14:38.000 --> 14:39.482
- AND DON'T WORRY
ABOUT JERRY HERE.
- 别担心
关于杰瑞在这里。

14:39.586 --> 14:41.206
I'LL MAKE SURE
HE GETS HIS NIGHTLY CRAWL.
我会确定
他每晚都会爬行。

14:41.310 --> 14:42.413
- [muffled]
GARY.
- [低声]
加里。

14:47.517 --> 14:50.448
[coins jingling]
[金币叮当作响]

14:53.206 --> 14:55.034
- [chuckles]
EXCUSE ME, MA'AM.
- [轻笑]
对不起，女士。

14:55.137 --> 14:56.034
[whistles]
[口哨声]

15:01.827 --> 15:04.551
DIRTY MONEY SPENDS
JUST LIKE THE CLEAN STUFF.
脏钱花
就像干净的东西一样。

15:04.655 --> 15:06.068
OOP.
面向对象编程。

15:06.172 --> 15:09.344
SPONGEBOB,
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?
海绵宝宝，
你在这里做什么？

15:09.448 --> 15:12.000
- MR. KRABS,
I FINISHED THE--
- 先生。螃蟹，
我完成了——

15:12.103 --> 15:13.689
[retches]
[干呕]

15:13.793 --> 15:15.206
I FINISHED
SCRUBBING THE FRYER, SIR.
我完成了
擦洗炸锅，先生。

15:15.310 --> 15:16.793
- YOU SURE MADE
EASY WORK OF IT.
- 你确实做到了
简单易行。

15:16.896 --> 15:20.482
- TRY TELLING THAT
TO MY FRIZZLED HANDS.
- 尝试讲述这一点
到我卷曲的双手。

15:20.586 --> 15:21.793
- YOU GOT
TO KEEP WORKING, BOY.
- 你得到了
继续工作，孩子。

15:21.896 --> 15:22.965
- I DO?
- 我愿意？

15:23.068 --> 15:23.965
- YEAH.
- 是的。

15:24.068 --> 15:25.344
WHY DON'T YOU, UM,
你为什么不，嗯，

15:25.448 --> 15:27.655
REARRANGE THE WALL RIVETS
FROM SMALLEST TO LARGEST?
重新排列墙壁铆钉
从最小到最大？

15:27.758 --> 15:29.034
- HEY, AREN'T THEY
THE SAME SIZE?
- 嘿，不是吗
相同尺寸？

15:29.137 --> 15:31.482
- THAT'S WHAT THEY WANT YOU
TO BELIEVE, BOYO.
- 这就是他们想要的
相信，男孩。

15:31.586 --> 15:35.034
NOW, GET BACK IN THERE
AND TAKE A LONG LOOK.
现在，回到那里
仔细观察。

15:35.137 --> 15:36.586
- WILL DO, CAP'N.
- 会的，船长。

15:36.689 --> 15:38.689
LA, LA-LA, LA-LA,
LA-LA-LA.
洛杉矶，洛杉矶-洛杉矶，洛杉矶-洛杉矶，
拉-拉-拉。

15:38.793 --> 15:39.931
- HOO!
- 呼！

15:40.034 --> 15:42.000
NOW BACK TO OUR LITTLE
TREASURE HUNT, EH, BOY?
现在回到我们的小
寻宝，嗯，男孩？

15:42.103 --> 15:43.206
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

15:43.310 --> 15:44.896
- YOU OKAY, BARRY?
- 你还好吗，巴里？

15:45.000 --> 15:47.655
[coins jingling]
[金币叮当作响]

15:50.206 --> 15:52.206
ATTABOY.
阿塔男孩。

15:52.310 --> 15:54.448
- MR. KRABS WAS RIGHT.
- 先生。蟹蟹是对的。

15:54.551 --> 15:58.068
A COUPLE OF THESE RIVETS ARE OFF
BY AS MUCH AS FIVE NANOMETERS.
其中几个铆钉脱落
高达五纳米。

15:58.172 --> 16:00.000
WELL, I'D BETTER
GET TO WORK.
嗯，我最好
开始工作吧。

16:04.172 --> 16:07.068
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

16:07.172 --> 16:08.793
- HEY, HEY, HEY, HEY, HEY.
- 嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿。

16:08.896 --> 16:10.172
WE AIN'T GOT TIME FOR THAT.
我们没有时间这么做。

16:10.275 --> 16:12.655
THERE'S A LAUNDROMAT
THAT NEEDS TO BE CLEANED OUT.
有一家自助洗衣店
需要清理掉。

16:12.758 --> 16:14.724
[laughs]
CLEANED OUT.
[笑]
清理干净。

16:14.827 --> 16:15.896
GET IT?
得到它？

16:16.000 --> 16:18.586
AH, NEVER MIND.
MUSH!
啊，没关系。
糊涂！

16:18.689 --> 16:19.896
- [meows]
- [喵]

16:20.000 --> 16:22.379
- IF YOU DON'T GET MOVING,
I'M GONNA--
- 如果你不行动起来，
我要——

16:22.482 --> 16:24.655
- YOU'RE GONNA DO WHAT, SIR?
- 先生，你要做什么？

16:24.758 --> 16:29.206
- EH, I WAS GONNA GIVE HIM
A SNAILY TREAT.
- 呃，我本来要给他的
缓慢的款待。

16:29.310 --> 16:31.344
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

16:31.448 --> 16:32.896
- SEE?
- 看？

16:33.000 --> 16:35.103
- [muffled yowling]
- [低沉的嚎叫声]

16:35.206 --> 16:37.172
- OH, OKAY.
- 哦好的。

16:37.275 --> 16:39.310
THOSE RIVETS ARE ALL REARRANGED,
MR. KRABS.
那些铆钉都重新排列了，
先生。螃蟹。

16:39.413 --> 16:40.965
- HOW IS THAT POSSIBLE?
- 这怎么可能？

16:41.068 --> 16:42.620
UH, OKAY, THEN,
呃，好吧，那么，

16:42.724 --> 16:46.137
NOW I WANT YOU
TO PAINT THE KRUSTY KRAB.
现在我想要你
画脆皮蟹。

16:46.241 --> 16:48.000
- NO PROBLEM.
THAT'S EASY.
- 没问题。
这很简单。

16:48.103 --> 16:50.172
- EH, EH, EH,
BUT I WANT YOU TO DO IT
-呃，呃，呃，
但我希望你这么做

16:50.275 --> 16:51.482
WITH THIS TOOTHBRUSH.
用这款牙刷。

16:51.586 --> 16:53.517
- SURE THING, SIR.
- 当然可以，先生。

16:53.620 --> 16:55.103
BYE, LITTLE PAL.
再见，小伙伴。

16:55.206 --> 16:56.379
- [meows]
- [喵]

16:56.482 --> 16:57.517
- OH, HO, HO.
- 哦，哈，哈。

16:57.620 --> 16:59.413
DON'T WORRY ABOUT TERRY.
别担心特里。

16:59.517 --> 17:01.689
HE'S IN GOOD CLAWS.
他的状态很好。

17:01.793 --> 17:04.482
- I'M SURE HE IS.
GOOD-BYE.
- 我确信他是。
再见。

17:04.586 --> 17:06.586
- NOW, LITTLE SNEAGLE,
- 现在，小鬼，

17:06.689 --> 17:09.413
ARE YOU READY
TO DO SOME LAUNDRY?
你准备好了吗
洗衣服？

17:09.517 --> 17:11.448
[laughs]
[笑]

17:13.862 --> 17:17.586
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

17:17.689 --> 17:18.586
- HUH?
- 嗯？

17:18.689 --> 17:19.758
HEY.
嘿。

17:19.862 --> 17:21.793
WHERE'S MY CHANGE?
我的零钱在哪里？

17:21.896 --> 17:23.793
- [laughing]
- [笑]

17:23.896 --> 17:25.275
- WELL, THAT STINKS.
- 嗯，那很臭。

17:25.379 --> 17:27.724
- [laughing]
- [笑]

17:27.827 --> 17:31.068
I'LL BET HE DIDN'T
SEE THAT COMING.
我敢打赌他没有
看到那即将到来。

17:31.172 --> 17:33.620
HEY, WHAT'S THE BIG IDEA--
嘿，有什么好主意——

17:33.724 --> 17:35.620
ER...
呃……

17:35.724 --> 17:40.413
WE JUST FOUND THE POT
AT THE END OF THE RAINBOW.
我们刚刚找到了锅
在彩虹的尽头。

17:40.517 --> 17:43.551
[laughs]
[笑]

17:43.655 --> 17:45.586
[machines dinging]
[机器叮当作响]

17:54.275 --> 17:56.827
- WHAT THE--
- 什么--

17:56.931 --> 17:58.724
- [laughing]
- [笑]

17:58.827 --> 18:00.965
IT'S JUST LIKE TAKING CANDY
FROM A BABY.
就像吃糖果一样
来自婴儿。

18:01.068 --> 18:03.620
- AND THEN IT WENT WHOOSH
OVER THERE.
- 然后事情就急转直下
在那儿。

18:03.724 --> 18:05.896
AND THE COINS
JUST FLEW FROM THE MACHINE.
和硬币
刚刚从机器上飞走。

18:06.000 --> 18:09.655
- DON'T WORRY, SIR.
WE'LL GET TO THE BOTTOM OF THIS.
- 别担心，先生。
我们会追根究底的。

18:09.758 --> 18:11.413
- UH-OH, THEY'RE ON TO US.
- 呃-哦，他们来找我们了。

18:11.517 --> 18:13.034
TIME FOR PLAN "B."
是时候实施“B”计划了。

18:16.965 --> 18:18.724
- AH, THAT SHOULD DO IT.
- 啊，应该可以了。

18:23.241 --> 18:25.344
AH, I BETTER CHECK IN
WITH MR. KRABS
啊，我最好登记一下
与先生。蟹蟹

18:25.448 --> 18:27.931
AND SEE IF HE NEEDS ME TO DO
ANY MORE IMPOSSIBLE STUFF.
看看他是否需要我做
还有更多不可能的事情。

18:28.034 --> 18:30.344
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

18:30.448 --> 18:31.793
- OH, BOY.
- 哦，男孩。

18:31.896 --> 18:33.862
I'M NOT GONNA HEAR
THE END OF THIS WHEN I GET HOME.
我不会听
当我回到家时，一切就结束了。

18:33.965 --> 18:35.000
- PARDON ME, SIR.
-请原谅我，先生。

18:35.103 --> 18:36.344
YOU HAVEN'T SEEN A KRAB
你还没见过螃蟹

18:36.448 --> 18:38.000
WALKING AROUND WITH A SNAIL,
HAVE YOU?
带着蜗牛走来走去，
你有吗？

18:38.103 --> 18:40.275
- SAY, ARE YOU IN WITH THOSE
THIEVING CRIMINALS TOO?
- 说，你参与其中吗？
也有盗窃犯罪分子？

18:40.379 --> 18:41.551
- THIEVING WHAT?
- 偷什么？

18:41.655 --> 18:43.896
- THEM TWO JERKS
WHAT STOLE MY MONEY.
- 他们两个混蛋
是什么偷了我的钱。

18:44.000 --> 18:47.034
THE FAT ONE USED HIS SNEAGLE
TO SWIPE MY COINS FROM ME.
胖子用了他的鬼鬼祟祟的手段
从我身上盗走我的硬币。

18:47.137 --> 18:48.482
- HIS SNEAGLE?
- 他的鬼祟？

18:48.586 --> 18:49.862
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- 这是正确的。

18:49.965 --> 18:51.758
WHY, THE COINS WERE STICKIN'
RIGHT TO ITS SHELL.
为什么硬币会粘在一起
对其外壳的权利。

18:51.862 --> 18:53.862
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

18:53.965 --> 18:56.241
[Mr. Krabs laughing]
[先生。螃蟹笑】

18:56.344 --> 18:58.965
- MR. KRABS,
WHAT HAVE YOU DONE TO MY GARY?
- 先生。螃蟹，
你对我的加里做了什么？

19:01.758 --> 19:04.620
HUH, SO THIS IS WHAT
A HOTBED OF SIN LOOKS LIKE.
嗯，所以这就是什么
罪恶的温床看起来像。

19:04.724 --> 19:05.931
[toilet flushes]
[厕所冲水]

19:06.034 --> 19:09.172
- [laughing]
- [笑]

19:09.275 --> 19:10.448
HOW'S IT GOING, BOYO?
怎么样，博约？

19:10.551 --> 19:13.068
YOU FEELING THE COIN VIBES?
您感受到硬币的氛围了吗？

19:13.172 --> 19:15.379
- [coughs]
- [咳嗽]

19:15.482 --> 19:17.413
[meows weakly]
[弱弱地喵喵叫]

19:17.517 --> 19:19.448
- WHAT DO YOU MEAN
YOU DON'T FEEL SO GOOD?
- 你是什么意思
你感觉不太好？

19:20.827 --> 19:25.206
- [meows]
- [喵]

19:25.310 --> 19:27.379
- YOU LOOK FINE TO ME.
- 我觉得你很好。

19:27.482 --> 19:28.724
NOW, QUIT BEING SUCH A BABY,
现在，别再像个婴儿了，

19:28.827 --> 19:30.068
AND START MAKING ME
SOME MONEY.
并开始让我
一些钱。

19:30.172 --> 19:32.379
EXCUSE ME.
EXCUSE ME.
打扰一下。
打扰一下。

19:32.482 --> 19:33.689
PREGNANT LADY
COMING THROUGH.
孕妇
即将到来。

19:33.793 --> 19:36.310
[laughing]
[笑]

19:36.413 --> 19:38.448
UH, HEE-HEE-HEE-HEE,
HOO, BOY.
呃，嘻嘻嘻嘻，
呼，男孩。

19:38.551 --> 19:42.172
IT SURE IS HARD
BEING PREGGERS.
这确实很难
怀孕了。

19:42.275 --> 19:45.172
- UH, YEAH.
- 呃，是的。

19:46.517 --> 19:48.517
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

19:48.620 --> 19:51.379
OOH!
哦！

19:51.482 --> 19:54.275
OH!
哦！

19:54.379 --> 19:56.689
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

19:56.793 --> 19:57.689
OOH.
哦。

19:57.793 --> 20:00.379
[coins jingling]
[金币叮当作响]

20:04.103 --> 20:06.000
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

20:08.655 --> 20:10.206
[stammering]
[结巴]

20:13.931 --> 20:17.758
[squeals]
[尖叫声]

20:17.862 --> 20:20.689
GET READY FOR A DOWNPOUR,
ME BOY.
为倾盆大雨做好准备，
我男孩。

20:20.793 --> 20:23.206
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
女士们，先生们，

20:23.310 --> 20:27.241
THANK YOU FOR YOUR MONEY.
谢谢您的钱。

20:27.344 --> 20:30.344
- HUH?
WHAT?
- 嗯？
什么？

20:32.586 --> 20:35.931
- COME ON, HARRY,
LET'S GO.
- 来吧，哈利，
我们走吧。

20:36.034 --> 20:37.137
COME ON, YOU.
来吧，你。

20:37.241 --> 20:39.482
- MR. KRABS.
- 先生。螃蟹。

20:39.586 --> 20:41.241
FOR SHAME.
耻辱。

20:41.344 --> 20:42.310
- WHAT DO YOU MEAN?
- 你是什么意思？

20:42.413 --> 20:43.758
I'M JUST SHOWING RORY OFF.
我只是在炫耀罗里。

20:43.862 --> 20:45.000
- DON'T YOU LIE TO ME.
- 别对我撒谎。

20:45.103 --> 20:48.517
I KNOW ALL ABOUT YOUR USING GARY
TO STEAL MONEY.
我知道你利用加里的一切
偷钱。

20:48.620 --> 20:49.827
- [squelching]
- [压抑]

20:49.931 --> 20:51.172
- I AM DOING NOTHING
OF THE SORT.
- 我什么也没做
这类的。

20:51.275 --> 20:53.241
I WOULD NEVER STEAL.
我永远不会偷窃。

20:53.344 --> 20:56.517
YOU HAVE TO QUIT
MAKING UP STORIES, BOYO.
你必须戒烟
编故事，男孩。

20:56.620 --> 20:57.758
- I'M NOT MAKING UP ANYTHING.
- 我没有编造任何事情。

20:57.862 --> 21:00.137
I KNOW ALL ABOUT
YOUR LITTLE SCHEME.
我知道所有关于
你的小计划。

21:00.241 --> 21:02.103
YOU'RE THE ONE
MAKING UP STORIES.
你就是那个
编造故事。

21:02.206 --> 21:05.551
[coins jingling]
[金币叮当作响]

21:08.000 --> 21:12.000
- DON'T YOU HAVE WORK
YOU SHOULD BE DOING?
- 你没有工作吗
你应该做什么？

21:12.103 --> 21:13.862
- OH, THAT'S RICH.
- 哦，太丰富了。

21:13.965 --> 21:15.689
- NO, IF I WAS RICH,
- 不，如果我很有钱，

21:15.793 --> 21:18.172
I WOULDN'T HAVE TO HIRE
THE LIKES OF YOU.
我不必雇用
您的喜好。

21:18.275 --> 21:20.344
- THAT'S HURTFUL, MR. KRABS,
AND YOU KNOW IT.
- 这很伤人，先生。螃蟹，
你知道的。

21:22.965 --> 21:25.517
- WHY, YOU LITTLE YELLOW--
- 为什么，你这个小黄人--

21:25.620 --> 21:27.068
WELL, I NEVER.
嗯，我从来没有。

21:27.172 --> 21:28.275
- YOU NEVER WHAT,
- 你永远不会，

21:28.379 --> 21:29.827
LEARNED TO USE
DECENT LANGUAGE?
学会使用
语言得体？

21:35.517 --> 21:36.586
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

21:36.689 --> 21:38.827
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

21:38.931 --> 21:42.103
- WHAT HAPPENED TO THE SWEET BOY
I HIRED SO LONG AGO?
- 可爱的男孩发生了什么事
我这么早就雇用了？

21:42.206 --> 21:45.862
WHO DO YOU THINK YOU ARE?
你以为你是谁？

21:47.241 --> 21:49.689
JACKPOT!
大奖！

21:49.793 --> 21:51.620
MONEY, MONEY, MONEY, MONEY,
MONEY, MONEY, MONEY.
钱，钱，钱，钱，
钱，钱，钱。

21:56.034 --> 21:57.793
COME TO PAPA.
来爸爸吧。

21:59.965 --> 22:01.931
OH, BOY.
哦，男孩。

22:03.068 --> 22:04.896
[monitor beeping]
[监视器蜂鸣声]

22:05.000 --> 22:07.068
- YEAH,
HE'S IN PRETTY BAD SHAPE
- 是的，
他的状态很糟糕

22:07.172 --> 22:08.551
WITH THE IMPACT
OF ALL THAT METAL,
具有影响力
所有这些金属，

22:08.655 --> 22:09.827
BUT HE'LL PULL THROUGH.
但他会挺过去的。

22:09.931 --> 22:12.172
- DOCTOR, HOW DOES
THIS SORT OF THING HAPPEN?
- 医生，怎么办？
会发生这种事吗？

22:12.275 --> 22:15.000
- I THINK THIS MIGHT HAVE HAD
SOMETHING TO DO WITH IT.
- 我想这可能已经发生了
与此有关的事情。

22:15.103 --> 22:18.448
- HEY, MY MERMAID MAN
AND BARNACLE BOY FRIDGE MAGNET.
- 嘿，我的美人鱼男人
和藤壶男孩冰箱贴。

22:18.551 --> 22:21.862
- YES, IT APPEARS
THAT YOUR PET SWALLOWED IT.
- 是的，它出现了
你的宠物吞下了它。

22:21.965 --> 22:25.758
IT HAS A VERY STRONG
MAGNETIC PULL.
它有很强的
磁力拉力。

22:25.862 --> 22:27.724
- 'CAUSE IT'S A MAGNET.
- 因为它是一块磁铁。

22:27.827 --> 22:29.310
THAT'S IT, MR. KRABS.
就是这样，先生。螃蟹。

22:29.413 --> 22:32.862
- [laughs]
WELL, WHAT DO YOU KNOW?
- [笑]
那么，你知道什么？

22:32.965 --> 22:35.379
- UNFORTUNATELY, THERE'S STILL
THE MATTER OF THE BILL.
- 不幸的是，还有
法案的问题。

22:35.482 --> 22:38.724
- WHAT?
OH, I CAN'T AFFORD THIS.
- 什么？
哦，我买不起。

22:38.827 --> 22:40.724
- ACTUALLY,
IT LOOKS LIKE YOU'VE GOT
- 事实上，
看起来你已经拥有了

22:40.827 --> 22:43.034
JUST ENOUGH CHANGE
TO COVER IT.
改变就够了
覆盖它。

22:47.275 --> 22:50.000
- NOOOOO!
- 不！

22:53.137 --> 22:56.034
